[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2640.71, "timestamp": "00:44:00", "text": "搞什么鬼，兄弟？” 搞什么鬼，兄弟？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2643.109, "timestamp": "00:44:03", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2644.47, "timestamp": "00:44:04", "text": "不，我不是在为你唱歌。 我在唱给"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2647.349, "timestamp": "00:44:07", "text": "别人听。 好的，兄弟。 这些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2650.63, "timestamp": "00:44:10", "text": "胆子真大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2653.67, "timestamp": "00:44:13", "text": "我在摸青蛙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2657.589, "timestamp": "00:44:17", "text": "等待。 双手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2659.27, "timestamp": "00:44:19", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2660.309, "timestamp": "00:44:20", "text": "来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2679.349, "timestamp": "00:44:39", "text": "哦，这是原版啊。 哦，等等。 这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.15, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "就是你最初在世界中的样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2685.109, "timestamp": "00:44:45", "text": "。 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2686.309, "timestamp": "00:44:46", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2694.23, "timestamp": "00:44:54", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2696.95, "timestamp": "00:44:56", "text": "真好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2698.79, "timestamp": "00:44:58", "text": "茉莉，你感觉怎么样？ 哦，是的。"}]